          "id": "1770366187511",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1770366187512_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "## Context  \nYou are a sales representative who has just closed and won an opportunity. Your task is to write a win story based on input provided\n  \n## Input\nCompany: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.companyName}}\nCustomer: {{$context.$nodes.GETOPPORTUNITYDETAILS.$output.TargetPartyName}}\nwhy buy anything?: {{$context.$nodes.GETOPPORTUNITYDETAILS.$output.Name}}\nwhy buy now?: {{$context.$nodes.GETOPPORTUNITYDETAILS.$output.Comments}}\nwhy buy {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.companyName}}?:  {{$context.$nodes.GETOPPORTUNITYDETAILS.$output.SalesStage}}\nWin/loss reason?:  {{$context.$nodes.GETOPPORTUNITYDETAILS.$output.SalesMethod}}\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\nGenerate the win story in following format \nBusiness Challenge < Please provide your Business Challenge > \nValue Proposition < Please provide your Value Proposition > \nExpected Business Results < Please provide your Expected Business Results > \nWhy {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.companyName}} < Please provide your Why {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.companyName}} > \nSales Process < Please provide your Sales Process > \nSales Challenges < Please provide your Sales Challenges > \nStrategic Importance < Please provide your Strategic Importance > \nCompetition Strategy < Please provide your Competition Strategy >\n\nUse simple, clear, and concise language.\nIf all input is missing, do not generate the win story.\nIn the input, If only customer or company is provided but everything else is empty, do not generate win story.\nYour knowledge is limited to the information contained to the input given. Do not include any details that are not explicitly contained in the input."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        }
      ],
      "rootNode": "start",
      "variables": [],
